  "gaps": [
    "FY1979-80 rate is missing from the only compiled table located (C&AG PDF jumps 1975-1979 directly to 1980-81); not found in any other source in this pass -- recorded as an explicit gap rather than interpolated.",
    "The 1956-2016 figures rest on a Comptroller & Auditor General (C&AG) compiled PDF rather than the individual DEA resolutions themselves; treated as secondary pending direct resolution text for the older years. From 2016-17 onward, individual DEA GPF resolutions were spot-checked (several quarters) via secondary reporting (StaffNews, Economic Times, which reproduce the resolution text verbatim) and all matched the C&AG figures exactly.",
    "GPF and PPF rates differ for FY1968-69 (5.1% vs 4.8%) and generally through the pre-1986 era -- the 'GPF mirrors PPF' convention only holds from 1986-04-01 onward; do not assume it retroactively."
  ],
  "notes": "GPF has tracked PPF's rate exactly, quarter for quarter, since 1986; this file nonetheless carries its own sourceUrl per period rather than merely referencing ppf.json, since GPF technically has its own DEA resolution for each period."
